WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.585
Every day Robot and Hope read MechaTron comics.

2
00:00:06.586 --> 00:00:13.712
They watched MechaTron on TV.

3
00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:17.876
Robot watched MechaTron do flips in the air.

4
00:00:17.877 --> 00:00:22.667
He watched him fire lasers and get bad guys.

5
00:00:22.668 --> 00:00:27.852
"MechaTron! MechaTron!" people cheered.

6
00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:30.738
That was Robot's favorite part.

7
00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:35.982
"I want to be awesome like that," Robot thought.

8
00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:39.969
One day Robot practiced being like MechaTron.

9
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.247
He punched and kicked the air.

10
00:00:42.248 --> 00:00:45.167
He kicked as hard as he could and . . .

11
00:00:45.168 --> 00:00:48.182
Bam! He fell over.

12
00:00:48.183 --> 00:00:52.349
"Great job!" Robot heard someone cheer.

13
00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:56.260
It was Noly, the little triceratops.

14
00:00:56.261 --> 00:01:01.890
"That was awesome, Robot!" Noly said.

15
00:01:01.891 --> 00:01:06.573
"I wish I was strong and tough like you."

16
00:01:06.574 --> 00:01:11.033
Robot huffed. "What are you doing here?"

17
00:01:11.034 --> 00:01:14.040
"I followed you," Noly said.

18
00:01:14.041 --> 00:01:18.333
"Because you're so cool!"

19
00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:20.892
Robot's lights flashed.

20
00:01:20.893 --> 00:01:23.242
"You're just a little dinosaur. You

21
00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:25.979
don't know what you're talking about. MechaTron

22
00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.900
is the one who's cool. Now

23
00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:30.934
leave me alone!" Robot

24
00:01:30.935 --> 00:01:34.987
spun around. He

25
00:01:34.988 --> 00:01:39.892
had one more idea for becoming like MechaTron. He

26
00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:43.386
started building something. He

27
00:01:43.387 --> 00:01:48.384
put pieces together. Soon

28
00:01:48.385 --> 00:01:51.706
he had a pair of wings. "These

29
00:01:51.707 --> 00:01:56.341
will work!" Robot said. Robot

30
00:01:56.342 --> 00:01:59.833
climbed up onto the bed. He

31
00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:03.957
went to the edge and took a deep breath. "Wow!"

32
00:02:03.958 --> 00:02:10.060
Noly said. "You're going to fly!" Robot

33
00:02:10.061 --> 00:02:11.998
ignored her. He

34
00:02:11.999 --> 00:02:17.514
began to count. "One, two, three!" Then—

35
00:02:17.515 --> 00:02:20.772
crash!

36
00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:23.261
Robot fell to the floor.

37
00:02:23.262 --> 00:02:26.731
"Ouch!" Robot yelled.

38
00:02:26.732 --> 00:02:30.031
Noly cheered again.

39
00:02:30.032 --> 00:02:34.579
"That was a really good try," she said.

40
00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.320
Robot rubbed his sore arm.

41
00:02:37.321 --> 00:02:40.137
He glared at the little dinosaur.

42
00:02:40.138 --> 00:02:47.948
"I told you, Noly! Leave me alone!"

